### StockFlow API - Colección de pruebas
### Requiere la extensión REST Client de VSCode
### Arrancar servidor: npm run dev

@base = http://localhost:3000
@adminToken = REEMPLAZAR_CON_TOKEN_DE_LOGIN
@operatorToken = REEMPLAZAR_CON_TOKEN_DE_LOGIN


### ─── AUTH ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Registrar usuario ADMIN
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nuevoadmin@stockflow.com",
  "password": "admin123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

### 2. Registrar usuario OPERATOR
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nuevooperator@stockflow.com",
  "password": "operator123",
  "role": "OPERATOR"
}

###

### 3. Login ADMIN (copiar token en @adminToken)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@stockflow.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### 4. Login OPERATOR (copiar token en @operatorToken)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "operator@stockflow.com",
  "password": "operator123"
}

###

### 5. Login con credenciales incorrectas (esperado: 401)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@stockflow.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### 6. Login con body inválido (esperado: 400 Zod)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "no-es-un-email"
}


### ─── PRODUCTOS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 7. Listar todos los productos (autenticado)
GET {{base}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 8. Listar productos filtrados por categoría (categoryId=1)
GET {{base}}/api/products?categoryId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 9. Crear producto (ADMIN)
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Teclado Mecánico",
  "sku": "ELEC-003",
  "stock": 20,
  "minStock": 5,
  "price": 89.99,
  "categoryId": 1
}

###

### 10. Crear producto sin token (esperado: 401)
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Producto sin auth",
  "sku": "X-001",
  "stock": 10,
  "minStock": 2,
  "price": 9.99,
  "categoryId": 1
}

###

### 11. Crear producto como OPERATOR (esperado: 403)
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

{
  "name": "Producto prohibido",
  "sku": "X-002",
  "stock": 10,
  "minStock": 2,
  "price": 9.99,
  "categoryId": 1
}

###

### 12. Actualizar producto (ADMIN)
PUT {{base}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "price": 1199.99,
  "stock": 10
}

###

### 13. Eliminar producto (ADMIN)
DELETE {{base}}/api/products/4
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 14. Eliminar producto inexistente (esperado: 404)
DELETE {{base}}/api/products/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ─── REPORTES ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 15. Reporte de stock bajo (ADMIN)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 16. Reporte de stock bajo como OPERATOR (esperado: 403)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}


### ─── PEDIDOS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 17. Crear pedido exitoso (stock suficiente)
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 3, "quantity": 3 }
  ]
}

###

### 18. Crear pedido con stock insuficiente (esperado: 400 + rollback)
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 999 }
  ]
}

###

### 19. Crear pedido con body inválido (esperado: 400 Zod)
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

{
  "items": []
}

###

### 20. Ver detalles de un pedido
GET {{base}}/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 21. Ver pedido inexistente (esperado: 404)
GET {{base}}/api/orders/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 22. Cambiar estado a DISPATCHED
PATCH {{base}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

{
  "status": "DISPATCHED"
}

###

### 23. Cancelar pedido (reintegra stock automáticamente)
PATCH {{base}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

{
  "status": "CANCELLED"
}

###

### 24. Intentar actualizar pedido ya cancelado (esperado: 400)
PATCH {{base}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

{
  "status": "DISPATCHED"
}

###

### 25. Status inválido (esperado: 400 Zod)
PATCH {{base}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

{
  "status": "INVALIDO"
}
